// A free answer (prose or a proof) is never decided by the checker. check_pending
// says what the checker can say about one: "pending" when something was written,
// so the session sends it on to the grader or to the learner's own grading, and
// "unparseable" when the answer is blank, which is a slip and not an attempt.

check_pending(string check_attempt) {
  string check_status = "unparseable";
  if (check_flatten(check_attempt) != "") {
    check_status = "pending";
  }
} return string check_status;
("Assume f(a) = f(b)."):("pending")
("  \n "):("unparseable")
(""):("unparseable")
("x"):("pending")
